68	    /**
69	     * Formats an owner's membership number as {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'}, where
70	     * {@code customerCode} is the owner's {@code '<REGION>-<HASH8>'} customer code and
71	     * {@code YY} is the last two digits of the registration date's year (e.g.
72	     * {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26'}), as required by the API's read-only
73	     * {@code membershipNumber} field. Returns {@code null} when either the customer code
74	     * or registration date is absent.
